\uc2  'It's hard to say what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trying to do,' one dealer said. 'It seems to be a political decision.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-05-96 \par \par \uc2  1117GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5m04akk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
