\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Up Vs. Dollar; Possible  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 April 1996\par 10:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty opened higher against the dollar and moved up slightly Tuesday as foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  entered the market following Monday's auction of Treasury bills. \par \par \uc2  Around 0815 GMT, the dollar was at 2.6220 zlotys, down from 2.6230 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 2.6270 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.7390 zlotys, unchanged from the opening but up from Monday's fixing of 1.7385 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  With the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at about 2.8% below its central parity rate, some dealers said there was a chance the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  In recent weeks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the dollar threatened to fall below 2.9% of the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  'There's strong pressure to sell dollars,' said a dealer at Bank Handlowy. He said banks were testing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's informal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  boundary. \par \par \uc2  Dealers reported upward pressure on the zloty as a result of Monday's T-bill auction. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investors pumped an estimated $200 million into the market, attracted by the increased rating for zloty-denominated notes released last week by Standard & Poor's. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.80% and 22.83%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-04-96 \par \par \uc2  08