\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's Zloty Opens Dn But Inches Upward On Low Volume \b0\par\par\uc2 284 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 April 1996\par 13:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty opened lower against the dollar before edging upward Monday on low trading volume. \par \par \uc2  Around 1000 GMT, the dollar was at 2.6268 zlotys, down slightly from 2.6275 zlotys at the opening of trading but up from Friday's fixing of 2.6200 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.7385 zlotys, down slightly from 1.7390 zlotys at the opening and down from Friday's fixing of 1.7450 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been checking exchange rates but saw \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as unlikely. \par \par \uc2  Also, remarks by Witold Kozinski, vice president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Poland, that an interest rate cut wasn't in the foreseeable future caused some uncertainty, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  With interest rates remaining high, foreign investors can be expected to increase purchases of Treasury bills, thus boosting demand for the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said a dealer at Bank Polska Kasa Opieki SA. \par \par \uc2  'Everyone is waiting for the treasury bill auction,' scheduled to take place on Monday afternoon, the dealer said. On the other hand, he added, there could also be a considerable supply of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as money is returned to foreign investors who tried unsuccessfully to buy shares in Poland's Okocim brewery. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investors had put down 376.7 million zlotys to buy shares in the new Okocim issue, which was oversubscribed. Of the total, 127.4 million zlotys will be returned to investors who failed to get shares. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates on Monday were indicated at between 22.70% and 22.85%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-04-96 \par \par \uc2  1120GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4f036qa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
