\par\par \b \uc2  Poland's Zloty Slips Against Dollar In Nervous Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 April 1996\par 12:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty weakened against the dollar in nervous trading Monday but gained slightly as dealers gambled on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0940 GMT, the dollar was at 2.5889 zlotys, up from 2.5845 zlotys at the opening and from Tuesday's fixing of 2.5820 zlotys. The Deutsche mark was at 1.7479 zlotys, down from 1.7488 zlotys at the opening but up Tuesday's fixing of 1.7435 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was highly volatile, with the dollar peaking at about 2.5905 zlotys before declining again. \par \par \uc2  The dollar opened at a level of close to 2.9% below its parity rate, leading to expectations that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would start buying dollars. In the past, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying dollars when the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  falls more than 2.5% below the parity rate set by the bank. \par \par \uc2  'People have been buying dollars thinking the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and pull up the market,' said a dealer at Bank Handlowy. Dealers said they were puzzled when \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  wasn't forthcoming. \par \par \uc2  'There's no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Everybody's wondering what's happening,' said a dealer at ABN AMRO Bank in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were quoted between 22.70% and 22.82%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-04-96 \par \par \uc2  1019GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4302wlk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
