\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Up Vs Dlr, DEM; Dealers Fear  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 April 1996\par 10:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty climbed against both the dollar and Deutsche mark on Tuesday to a level that generally triggers \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0810 GMT, the dollar was at 2.5835 zlotys, down from 2.5878 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 2.5875 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The mark was at 1.7443 zlotys, down from 1.7458 zlotys at the opening and Monday's fixing of 1.7465 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  'It's a definite strengthening of the zloty,' said Piotr Konarski of Bank Handlowy. \par \par \uc2  The zloty's rise was fueled in part by the influx of foreign capital into the market for Polish Treasury bills, Konarski said. \par \par \uc2  Although the dollar dipped to more than 2.8% below its central parity rate Monday, there was no immediate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a new policy. It has tried to introduce some risk and volatility into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market,' Konarski said. \par \par \uc2  In the past, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  routinely when the dollar moved below 2.5% of its parity rate. Now, Konarksi said, the situation is more uncertain. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.60% and 22.75%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-04-96 \par \pa