\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Polish  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  acts to cap zloty rise. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Wojciech Moskwa \par \uc2 465 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1996\par 18:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, March 13 (Reuter) - The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP) awoke from a weeks-long slumber on Wednesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stop the zloty's rise against the dollar and the mark, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar buying \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was an attempt not to weaken the zloty, but to re-establish its past resistance levels in case banks forgot about them during several weeks of more balanced trade. \par \par \uc2  The zloty was stopped when it rose to 2.53 percent from the dollar and mark parity rate -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band -- with a symbolic $10 million purchase at 2.5690 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the zloty's rise and the subsequent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  action came as no surprise to the market, saturated with \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  from huge cross-border trade inflows. \par \par \uc2  Unregistered trade was estimated to have contributed some six billion dollars to Poland's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves last year. \par \par \uc2  "The NBP wanted to show the market that the zloty's past resistance levels are still well guarded," said Przemyslaw Ciszecki, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at ING bank in Warsaw. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said today's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level was likely to serve as the zloty's near-term ceiling and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would need to buy more dollars from the market if it wanted to keep the zloty from strengthening in the longer term. \par \par \uc2  "The zloty's appreciation in the future is inevitable," said Jan Mieczkowski, treasurer at Deutsche Bank Polska. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the zloty was now likely to spend a week or two hovering around the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level of 2.5 percent from the parity rate and occasionally stab at resistance. \par \par \uc2  But analysts said it very weak short-term support and could be volatile if the market was flooded with zlotys, as was the case in February when foreign investors took profits on part of their Polish T-bill portfolios. \par \par \uc2  "Another wave of withdrawing foreign investors could easily reverse the zloty's natural upward inclination in the short term," one \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a foreign bank here said. \par \par \uc2  Last month investors began to sell Polish T-bills as yields started to bottom out after an early January interest rate cut and the ensuing four point drop in T-bill yields. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday the zloty was fixed at an average of 2.52 percent from the parity rate at 2.5685 to the dollar and at 1.7460 to the mark. \par \par \uc2  The Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is devalued one percent per month against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  comprising the U.S. dollar and the German mark as well as the British pound and Swiss and French francs. \par \par \uc2  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds3d006uv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
