\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Up Vs Dlr;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen Unlikely \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Februar 1996\par 10:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was calm on Wednesday, with dealers seeing little chance of renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 0930 GMT, the dollar was at 2.5430 zlotys, down from the opening of 2.5442 and from Tuesday's fixing of 2.5480 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.7303 zlotys, up from 1.7295 zlotys at the opening and from Tuesday's fixing of 1.7260 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's decline against the zloty mirrored its slippage against the mark in international markets, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  As a result, the average departure from the parity rate for the dollar and mark together was about minus 2.5%. \par \par \uc2  That is within the bounds tolerated by the National Bank of Poland, which seeks to prevent appreciation of the zloty above that level. \par \par \uc2  'We don't see a big supply of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market,' said Bodgan Stepkowksi of ING Bank. 'On the other hand, there isn't much interest in selling zlotys, either.' \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times on Tuesday to buy dollars and marks flooding the market as a result of orders from foreign investors who had bought Polish treasury bills. \par \par \uc2  Dealers estimated that the orders added between $50 million and $100 million to the market. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates were indicated at between 22.30% and 22.50%. \par \par \uc2  (E