\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Up Vs Dlr; Further  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Foreseen \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Februar 1996\par 11:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The Polish zloty was higher against the dollar Tuesday, with some dealers fearing further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Around 1020 GMT, the dollar was at 2.5325 zlotys, down from 2.5330 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 2.5395 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The Deutsche mark was at 1.7260 zlotys, up from 1.7250 zlotys at the opening and from Monday's fixing of 1.7230 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The dollar and mark were both about 2.55% below the parity rates established by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  within 2.50% of the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  'The zloty is getting stronger,' said Mateusz Bienek of Societe Generale. 'We can expect the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again today.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers said major recent sales of state-owned tobacco companies as well as the continued flow of foreign money into treasury bills and equities have flooded the Polish exchange market with hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , driving up the level of the zloty. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice to buy dollars and marks for zlotys. It first bought dollars at 2.5410 zlotys and marks at 1.7205 zlotys. It later bought dollars again at the level of 2.5400 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Overnight money market rates Tuesday were indicated at between 22.40% and 22.50%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-02-96 \par \par \uc2  1045GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds26011q4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
