\par\par \b \uc2  Poland  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 /Dlrs -2: Buys At 2.5400 Zlotys \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 1996\par 13:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the second time Monday to buy dollars for zlotys, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 1155 GMT, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars at the level of 2.5400 zlotys at several banks, dealers said. They said the purchases came in amounts of $5 million to $10 million each. \par \par \uc2  'The first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  turned out to be too weak,' one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Monday morning, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars and Deutsche marks. The bank bought dollars at the level of 2.5410 zlotys and marks at the level of 1.7205 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  At the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level, the dollar was at 2.69% below its parity rate for the zloty, dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has consistently sought to keep the dollar from falling below 2.5% from the parity rate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in response to the dollar's slide against the mark on international markets, which put downward pressure on the dollar against the zloty, said Marek Kucharski of Bank Gospodarki Zywniosciowej. \par \par \uc2  Around 1220 GMT, the dollar was trading at 1.4745 marks in Europe. \par \par \uc2  'If the dollar falls further against the mark we can expect further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' on the Polish market by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Kucharski said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-02-96 \par \par \uc2  1242GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds25010td\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
