ey market rates were indicated at between 25.00% and 25.25%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-01-96 \par \par \uc2  1010GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds14006wi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
