\par\par \b \uc2  ZLOTY EASES VS DLR AFTER BUBA, MONEY MARKET STABLE. \b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Nov 30 (Reuter) - The zloty closed softer against the dollar and virtually flat against the mark in active trade before and after the Bundesbank's decision to leave rates flat, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said Polish players bought dollars in the morning on expectations of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains against the mark but began squaring positions after news of no German rate change depressed the dollar on world markets. \par \par \uc2  "The market swung from dollar-buying in the morning to nervous selling after the Buba news and then some buying back again," said Marcin Stefaniuk of BDK SA. \par \par \uc2  The zloty closed at 2.5080/00 to the dollar, down from Wednesday's 2.5067/90 and at 1.7445/55 to the mark, flat from yesterday. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the zloty/mark rate was underpinned by fears of a Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  move against the zloty after the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged a surprise mark-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  After overnight rates dropped by more than a point on the last day of the November reserve yesterday, the money market balanced out around the one-day repo rate of 25.50 percent today and dealers expected no major changes tomorrow. \par \par \uc2  Turnover on the off-the-floor bond market jumped to 80.1 million zlotys today from 15.6 million on Wednesday, after weeks of calm, with the market's focus on three-year bonds. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said transaction prices of most of the bonds, which at 103.8 and 103.9 were almost one point above the going market price, signalled that deals were likely to have been a repo \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  between banks. \par \par \uc2  "The prices are high above the market, which might be a signal that the deals are a part of a repo \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Marcin Rzechowski of Bank Pekao SA. \par \par \uc2  -- Jan Strupczewski +48 22 653 9700 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040130drbu000xy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
