\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2 's Zloty Dips Against Dlr, DEM After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 November 1995\par 13:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  WARSAW (AP-DJ)--The zloty dipped against the dollar and Deutsche mark Thursday morning following \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy the mark from a single bank at 1.7363 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought from 20 million to 30 million marks - too little to have a significant impact on the market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Around 1130 GMT, the dollar was at 2.4693 zlotys, up slightly from 2.4685 at the opening and from Wednesday's fixing of 2.4615 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  The mark was at 1.7373 zlotys, up slightly from 1.7365 zlotys at the opening but down from than Wednesday's fixing of 1.7400 zlotys. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they were puzzled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , since the zloty was just 6.06% off the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's parity rate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'The zloty has been much farther from the parity rate and the national bank hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Jacek Baprawski of Bank Pekao SA. 'I think they are trying to scare the market.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move had the effect of widening the bid-offer spread for marks, dealers said. The bid price fell, while the offer price remained at the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level of 1.7364. \par \par \uc2  The zloty is allowed to float within 7 percentage points above or below the parity rate. Generally, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the zloty approaches the lower edge of the band, meaning that it is appreciating against Western \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1235GMT \par \par \uc2  1167 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drb908u39\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
