ght rates eased 0.20 point at bid from opening to close at 26.40/26.60 percent. \par \par \uc2  Tomorrow/next dropped by 0.15 point at bid to 26.45/26.60 percent depite a 394 million zloty net outflow on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -- Wojciech Moskwa +48 2 625 6303 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr95047af\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
