\par\par \b \uc2  NBP stops Polish zloty comeback vs dollar, O/N ease. \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, Aug 29 (Reuter) - The Polish zloty's climb against the dollar, which recouped some overnight losses, was capped by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  estimated at around $40 million. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar- and mark-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  stopped the zloty's advance and cleared excess hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the domestic interbank market but were not large enough to push down the Polish unit. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  cleared some excess dollars, stopping the zloty rise, but weren't big enough to depress the zloty," one dealer said. The zloty closed at 2.4712/27 to the dollar, down from Monday's 2.4640/65, after the NBP \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 2.4710. \par \par \uc2  It closed at 1.6825/40 against the mark, flat from 1.6823/38 after NBP mark-buying at 1.6840 and 1.6845. \par \par \uc2  Today's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised many dealers because they came at about 5.1 percent from the parity rate -- the centre of the 14-percent daily trading band -- below past \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels of more than 5.2 percent from parity. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that some dollar surpluses might have been created by dollar-selling to fill zloty reserve gaps on the domestic deposits market. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rates eased to one-day repo-rate levels as banks ended squaring their monthly reserves, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr8t04lqn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
