\par\par \b \uc2  Huge  \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions \highlight\uc2  ease Polish zloty. \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juli 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WARSAW, July 7 (Reuter) - The Polish zloty fell against the dollar in chaotic trade on Friday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought an estimated $100 million on the domestic interbank market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "It was the biggest day of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  far as I remember, there were big winners and big losers," said Marek Chrobak of Bank Zachodni SA. \par \par \uc2  Numerous \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  triggered a wild dollar-buying trend and caused the zloty to ease by more than a grosz, or one hundreth, to the dollar from Thursday's close of 2.3605. \par \par \uc2  "Banks tried to close their positions, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had all of the dollars," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Continously large inflows of export revenues has put a strong upward pressure on the zloty and caused the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBP), \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly on the interbank market since mid-May's float. \par \par \uc2  The zloty was partially floated on the domestic interbank market when its daily trading band widened from four to 14 percent on May 15. \par \par \uc2  The float, widely expected to strengthen the Polish unit and ease pressure of inflation-causing hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows, was followed by about a four percent appreciation of the zloty. \par \par \uc2  Since that time the NBP has consistantly bought small amounts of dollars and marks whenever market rates drifted much more than five percent from the parity rate, the centre of the daily trading band. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr770657f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
